shortdesc LaTeX interface for the CJK category codes of upTeX
longdesc The package provides management of the CJK category code
longdesc ('kcatcode'> table of the upTeX extended TeX engine. Package
longdesc options are available for tailored use in the cases of
longdesc documents that are principally written in Japanese, or
longdesc principally written in English or other Western languages.
